---
import Shell from '../layouts/NorthlineShell.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
import '../styles/v5.css';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/') ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
const asset = (file: string) => `${base}${file.replace(/^\/+/, '')}`;
const endpoint = String(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_LEAD_ENDPOINT || '').trim();
---
<Shell
 title="NORTHLINE | International Property Exploration and Investor Brief"
 description="Explore fictional residential opportunities across Dubai, Lisbon and London. Compare illustrative property scenarios, complete a seven-step investor brief and model rental yield with clear assumptions."
>
<section class="hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="hero-media"><img src={asset('assets/advisory-residence.webp')} width="1380" height="777" alt="Original fictional waterfront architecture study" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="hero-vignette"></div><div class="hero-inner"><div class="hero-topline"><span>INTERNATIONAL PROPERTY / A DIFFERENT PERSPECTIVE</span><span class="hero-counter">01 — 05</span></div><div class="hero-middle"><div class="hero-overline"><span class="glow-dot"></span> YOUR NEXT PROPERTY, MORE CONSIDERED</div><h1 id="hero-title">Make room for<br><em>what's next.</em></h1><p>Explore international property through your priorities — from the place to the numbers behind the decision.</p><form class="quick-search" id="quick-search" aria-label="Explore sample opportunities"><div class="field"><label for="search-market">Destination</label><select id="search-market" name="market"><option value="open">All markets</option><option value="dubai">Dubai</option><option value="lisbon">Lisbon</option><option value="london">London</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="search-budget">Budget</label><select id="search-budget" name="budget"><option value="">Any budget</option><option value="under-300k">Under $300k</option><option value="300-600k">$300–600k</option><option value="600k-1m">$600k–1M</option><option value="over-1m">$1M+</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="search-goal">Your objective</label><select id="search-goal" name="objective"><option value="">Select objective</option><option value="income">Rental income</option><option value="personal">Personal use</option><option value="growth">Long-term growth</option><option value="diversify">Diversification</option></select></div><button class="find-button" type="submit">Explore <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></form><a class="hero-secondary" href="#markets">Discover the markets <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><div class="hero-bottomline"><span>NO AVAILABLE INVENTORY / DESIGN CONCEPT</span><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE <b aria-hidden="true">↓</b></span></div></div></section><section class="markets" id="markets"><div class="container"><div class="section-kicker">01 / FIND YOUR PLACE</div><div class="title-split"><h2>Explore our <span>markets.</span></h2><p>Three different destinations, each with its own way of living, costs and considerations.</p></div><div class="market-picker" aria-label="Choose a market"><button type="button" data-market="dubai" aria-pressed="true">Dubai <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><button type="button" data-market="lisbon" aria-pressed="false">Lisbon <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><button type="button" data-market="london" aria-pressed="false">London <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><button type="button" data-market="open" aria-pressed="false">Explore all markets <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div><div class="region-grid"><article class="region-card" data-region="dubai"><div class="region-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1745750434535-5943ef2fd31a?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1400&amp;q=80" alt="Licensed editorial photograph of Dubai city skyline" loading="lazy" width="836" height="470"></div><div class="region-details"><span>WATERFRONT / CITY LIFE</span><h3>Dubai</h3><p>Modern coastal living, fast-moving development and a distinctive cost structure.</p><a href="#investor-brief" data-prefill-market="dubai">Explore Dubai <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article><article class="region-card" data-region="lisbon"><div class="region-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1775898879981-92b6d4537b19?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1400&amp;q=80" alt="Licensed editorial photograph of Lisbon city rooftops" loading="lazy" width="836" height="470"></div><div class="region-details"><span>LIFESTYLE / CHARACTER</span><h3>Lisbon</h3><p>Architectural character, neighbourhood context and a considered approach to ownership.</p><a href="#investor-brief" data-prefill-market="lisbon">Explore Lisbon <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article><article class="region-card" data-region="london"><div class="region-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772339164384-e4eba87f08c0?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1400&amp;q=80" alt="Licensed editorial photograph of London skyline" loading="lazy" width="836" height="470"></div><div class="region-details"><span>GLOBAL CITY / CONNECTIVITY</span><h3>London</h3><p>Urban homes, leasing structures and complex, property-specific ownership costs.</p><a href="#investor-brief" data-prefill-market="london">Explore London <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article></div><p class="sample-note">Market photographs show real cities under the Unsplash License. Featured properties and all prices are fictional examples, not listings or investment advice.</p></div></section><section id="opportunities" class="featured section-light"><div class="container"><div class="section-kicker">02 / OPPORTUNITY STUDIES</div><div class="title-split"><div><h2>Places worth <span>exploring.</span></h2><p class="subtitle">A collection of fictional home concepts created to show how property priorities can differ.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="#investor-brief">Explore your fit <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="property-grid"><article class="property-card"><div class="property-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1768463851972-c0a9fc7dc60c?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1400&amp;q=80" alt="Licensed editorial architecture photograph of Dubai; fictional scenario, not a listing" width="962" height="536" loading="lazy"><span class="tag">SAMPLE CONCEPT</span></div><div class="property-body"><div class="property-meta"><span>DUBAI / READY RESIDENCE</span><span>EXAMPLE 01</span></div><h3>The Dubai Residential Study</h3><div class="property-price">$480,000 <small>illustrative planning figure</small></div><div class="property-specs"><span>2 BR</span><span>115 m²</span><span>NOT AVAILABLE</span></div><a href="#investor-brief" data-prefill-market="dubai">Build a matching brief <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article><article class="property-card"><div class="property-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1754765297157-d4f7c3c941e5?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1400&amp;q=80" alt="Licensed editorial architecture photograph of Lisbon; fictional scenario, not a listing" width="962" height="536" loading="lazy"><span class="tag">SAMPLE CONCEPT</span></div><div class="property-body"><div class="property-meta"><span>LISBON / READY RESIDENCE</span><span>EXAMPLE 02</span></div><h3>The Lisbon Architecture Study</h3><div class="property-price">$450,000 <small>illustrative planning figure</small></div><div class="property-specs"><span>2 BR</span><span>132 m²</span><span>NOT AVAILABLE</span></div><a href="#investor-brief" data-prefill-market="lisbon">Build a matching brief <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article><article class="property-card"><div class="property-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772339164384-e4eba87f08c0?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1400&amp;q=80" alt="Licensed editorial architecture photograph of London; fictional scenario, not a listing" width="962" height="536" loading="lazy"><span class="tag">SAMPLE CONCEPT</span></div><div class="property-body"><div class="property-meta"><span>LONDON / CITY RESIDENCE</span><span>EXAMPLE 03</span></div><h3>The Urban Outlook</h3><div class="property-price">$890,000 <small>illustrative planning figure</small></div><div class="property-specs"><span>2 BR</span><span>94 m²</span><span>NOT AVAILABLE</span></div><a href="#investor-brief" data-prefill-market="london">Build a matching brief <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article></div></div></section><section id="developments" class="developments section-light"><div class="container"><div class="section-kicker">03 / THE NEXT CHAPTER</div><div class="title-split"><div><h2>New perspectives on <span>development.</span></h2><p class="subtitle">Ready and off-plan decisions call for different questions. These are imaginary architectural studies.</p></div><div class="carousel-controls"><button type="button" id="dev-prev" aria-label="Previous developments">←</button><button type="button" id="dev-next" aria-label="Next developments">→</button></div></div></div><div class="dev-scroll" id="dev-scroll" tabindex="0" aria-label="Example development concepts"><article class="dev-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1745750434535-5943ef2fd31a?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1400&amp;q=80" alt="Original fictional Dubai architectural concept" loading="lazy" width="836" height="470"><div class="dev-shade"></div><span class="dev-count">CONCEPT / 01</span><div class="dev-text"><small>DUBAI / FUTURE RESIDENCES</small><h3>The Coastal Collection</h3><a href="#investor-brief" data-prefill-market="dubai" aria-label="Explore example of The Coastal Collection">Explore concept ↗</a></div></article><article class="dev-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1775898879981-92b6d4537b19?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1400&amp;q=80" alt="Original fictional Lisbon architectural concept" loading="lazy" width="836" height="470"><div class="dev-shade"></div><span class="dev-count">CONCEPT / 02</span><div class="dev-text"><small>LISBON / DESIGN STUDY</small><h3>The Garden Apartments</h3><a href="#investor-brief" data-prefill-market="lisbon" aria-label="Explore example of The Garden Apartments">Explore concept ↗</a></div></article><article class="dev-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772339164384-e4eba87f08c0?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1400&amp;q=80" alt="Original fictional London architectural concept" loading="lazy" width="836" height="470"><div class="dev-shade"></div><span class="dev-count">CONCEPT / 03</span><div class="dev-text"><small>LONDON / CITY STUDY</small><h3>The Metropolitan House</h3><a href="#investor-brief" data-prefill-market="london" aria-label="Explore example of The Metropolitan House">Explore concept ↗</a></div></article><article class="dev-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1773668159554-cc536e381e09?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1400&amp;q=80" alt="Original fictional Dubai architectural concept" loading="lazy" width="836" height="470"><div class="dev-shade"></div><span class="dev-count">CONCEPT / 04</span><div class="dev-text"><small>DUBAI / DESIGN STUDY</small><h3>The Urban Future</h3><a href="#investor-brief" data-prefill-market="dubai" aria-label="Explore example of The Urban Future">Explore concept ↗</a></div></article></div></section><section class="world"><div class="container world-grid"><div class="world-copy"><div class="section-kicker">04 / THE BIGGER PICTURE</div><h2>Think globally.<br><span>Compare locally.</span></h2><p>Different markets create different questions. Use a single brief to compare the factors that matter: acquisition costs, readiness, ownership structure and your timeline.</p><div class="comparison-list"><div><b>01</b><span>Location and ownership</span></div><div><b>02</b><span>Acquisition and ongoing costs</span></div><div><b>03</b><span>Rent, use and exit options</span></div></div><a class="button solid-blue" href="#investor-brief">Start with your priorities <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="world-graphic" aria-label="Illustrative diagram connecting Dubai, Lisbon and London; not a geographic map"><div class="world-ring ring-one"></div><div class="world-ring ring-two"></div><div class="world-ring ring-three"></div><div class="world-center">N.</div><span class="world-pin pin-dubai">DUBAI <i></i></span><span class="world-pin pin-lisbon">LISBON <i></i></span><span class="world-pin pin-london">LONDON <i></i></span><span class="world-graphic-caption">THREE MARKETS / ONE DECISION FRAMEWORK</span></div></div></section><section id="calculator" class="calculator"><div class="container calculator-grid"><div class="calc-product"><div class="section-kicker">05 / INVESTMENT TOOL</div><div class="device-frame"><div class="device-bar"><span>NORTHLINE / MODEL</span><span class="device-dots">● ● ●</span></div><div class="device-body"><p>ESTIMATED RENTAL SCENARIO</p><div class="device-big"><span id="net-yield">4.97%</span></div><small>Illustrative net rental yield</small><div class="device-metrics"><div><span>Gross rental yield</span><strong id="gross-yield">7.00%</strong></div><div><span>Estimated net annual income</span><strong id="net-income">$22,350</strong></div></div><div class="device-bars"><span style="height:57%"></span><span style="height:83%"></span><span style="height:68%"></span><span style="height:100%"></span><span style="height:71%"></span><span style="height:87%"></span></div><small>DATA IS A FICTIONAL INPUT SCENARIO — NOT A RETURN FORECAST</small></div></div></div><div class="calc-copy"><h2>See beyond<br>the <span>headline yield.</span></h2><p>Test the relationship between price, rent, occupancy and ongoing costs. Changing one assumption changes the result.</p><div class="calculator-form"><div class="calc-input-grid"><label>Purchase price <span>USD</span><input type="number" data-calc="price" min="1" value="450000" step="1000" inputmode="numeric"></label><label>Annual rent <span>USD</span><input type="number" data-calc="rent" min="0" value="31500" step="500" inputmode="numeric"></label><label>Service charges <span>USD / YEAR</span><input type="number" data-calc="service" min="0" value="3600" step="100" inputmode="numeric"></label><label>Management costs <span>USD / YEAR</span><input type="number" data-calc="management" min="0" value="2400" step="100" inputmode="numeric"></label></div><label class="occupancy-label">Occupancy <output id="occupancy-value">90%</output><input type="range" data-calc="occupancy" min="0" max="100" step="5" value="90"></label></div><p class="calc-disclaimer">Illustrative model, not investment advice. Excludes financing, transaction taxes, capital costs, currency changes, and resale outcomes.</p></div></div></section><section id="investor-brief" class="brief"><div class="container brief-grid"><div class="brief-brand-panel"><div class="section-kicker">06 / YOUR DECISION, IN FOCUS</div><div class="brand-graphic" aria-hidden="true">N<span>.</span></div><h2>A better brief.<br><span>A better starting point.</span></h2><p>Define what matters first. Then see examples that reflect your answers — without a mandatory contact gate.</p><a href={`${base}brief/`}>Open the dedicated brief experience ↗</a></div><div class="quiz-interface" data-quiz data-assets={asset('assets/')}><div class="quiz-progress"><div><span>PERSONAL PROPERTY BRIEF</span><strong id="quiz-step-label" data-progress-label>01 / 07</strong></div><div class="progress-track" role="progressbar" aria-label="Investor brief progress" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="14" data-progress-track><span id="quiz-progress" data-progress-bar style="width:14%"></span></div></div><form id="investor-enquiry" data-capture-form data-endpoint={endpoint} action={`${base}api/lead`} method="post">
  <div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave this blank<input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label></div><fieldset data-quiz-step="0" ><legend>What budget range feels realistic?</legend><p>Choose the option that best describes your current thinking.</p><div class="quiz-options"><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="budget" value="under-300k"><span>Under $300,000</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="budget" value="300-600k"><span>$300,000–$600,000</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="budget" value="600k-1m"><span>$600,000–$1 million</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="budget" value="over-1m"><span>Above $1 million</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label></div></fieldset><fieldset data-quiz-step="1" hidden><legend>What should your property do for you?</legend><p>Choose the option that best describes your current thinking.</p><div class="quiz-options"><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="objective" value="income"><span>Rental income</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="objective" value="personal"><span>Personal use</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="objective" value="growth"><span>Long-term growth</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="objective" value="diversify"><span>Diversification</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label></div></fieldset><fieldset data-quiz-step="2" hidden><legend>Where are you looking?</legend><p>Choose the option that best describes your current thinking.</p><div class="quiz-options"><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="market" value="dubai"><span>Dubai</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="market" value="lisbon"><span>Lisbon</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="market" value="london"><span>London</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="market" value="open"><span>Open to several markets</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label></div></fieldset><fieldset data-quiz-step="3" hidden><legend>Which property stage?</legend><p>Choose the option that best describes your current thinking.</p><div class="quiz-options"><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="status" value="ready"><span>Ready / resale</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="status" value="offplan"><span>New-build / off-plan</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="status" value="both"><span>Open to either</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label></div></fieldset><fieldset data-quiz-step="4" hidden><legend>When might you decide?</legend><p>Choose the option that best describes your current thinking.</p><div class="quiz-options"><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="timeline" value="now"><span>Within 3 months</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="timeline" value="soon"><span>3–12 months</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="timeline" value="later"><span>Over 12 months</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="timeline" value="research"><span>Research stage</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label></div></fieldset><fieldset data-quiz-step="5" hidden><legend>How might you finance?</legend><p>Choose the option that best describes your current thinking.</p><div class="quiz-options"><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="financing" value="cash"><span>Cash</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="financing" value="loan"><span>Mortgage / financing</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="financing" value="mixed"><span>Cash and financing</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label><label class="quiz-choice"><input type="radio" name="financing" value="unknown"><span>Undecided</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></label></div></fieldset><fieldset data-quiz-step="6" hidden><legend>Would you like to stay in touch?</legend><p>Contact details are optional to view example options and required only if you choose to submit an enquiry.</p><div class="quiz-contact"><label>Your name<input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your name" autocomplete="name" minlength="2" required></label><label>Email address<input type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" required></label></div><label class="quiz-consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required><span>I agree to be contacted if I choose to submit an enquiry. <a href={`${base}privacy/`}>Privacy and demo notice</a>.</span></label></fieldset><p id="quiz-error" data-quiz-error class="quiz-error" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="quiz-actions"><button type="button" class="quiz-back" id="quiz-back" data-back hidden>← Back</button><button type="button" class="quiz-next" id="quiz-next" data-next>Continue <span>↗</span></button></div><div class="quiz-results" id="quiz-results" data-quiz-results hidden tabindex="-1" aria-live="polite"><p class="section-kicker">YOUR CONCEPT SHORTLIST</p><h3>Example directions for your brief.</h3><p id="quiz-results-summary" data-brief-summary></p><p hidden data-no-matches class="quiz-no-matches"></p><div id="quiz-matches" data-example-options class="match-list"></div><p class="fineprint">All options are fictional studies, not live listings or financial advice. Contact details are only transmitted after confirmed consent and with a configured secure endpoint.</p><button class="quiz-reset" id="quiz-reset" type="button">Revise answers ↺</button><button type="submit" class="quiz-submit">Send enquiry (demo) ↗</button><p data-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div></form></div></div></section><section id="insights" class="insights section-light"><div class="container"><div class="section-kicker">07 / PERSPECTIVES</div><div class="title-split"><div><h2>Questions worth <span>asking.</span></h2><p class="subtitle">Useful prompts for a better international property decision — not fabricated press coverage.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="#investor-brief">Build your brief ↗</a></div><div class="insight-grid"><article><span>01 / OWNERSHIP</span><h3>What does a home cost beyond the price?</h3><p>Consider charges, taxes, financing and ongoing reserves.</p><a href="#calculator">Explore the numbers ↗</a></article><article><span>02 / DEVELOPMENT</span><h3>Ready or off-plan: what changes?</h3><p>Explore delivery timing, payment obligations and verification.</p><a href="#developments">Compare stages ↗</a></article><article><span>03 / DESTINATION</span><h3>How should different markets be compared?</h3><p>Start with your usage, liquidity needs and local rules.</p><a href="#markets">Explore destinations ↗</a></article></div></div></section><section id="contact" class="contact"><div class="container contact-grid"><div class="contact-brand"><div class="section-kicker">08 / START A CONVERSATION</div><div class="contact-letter" aria-hidden="true">N.</div><h2>Let's talk about<br><span>your next move.</span></h2><p>One clear brief can change the way you approach your search.</p></div><div class="contact-panel"><p class="form-eyebrow">REQUEST AN INVESTOR DISCUSSION</p><h3>Start with what matters to you.</h3><form id="contact-enquiry" data-capture-form data-endpoint={endpoint} action={`${base}api/lead`} method="post"><div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave blank<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div><label>Name <span>*</span><input name="name" autocomplete="name" required minlength="2" placeholder="Your name"></label><label>Email <span>*</span><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@example.com"></label><label>Market of interest<select name="market"><option value="">Open to several markets</option><option>Dubai</option><option>Lisbon</option><option>London</option></select></label><label>What would you like to explore?<textarea name="message" rows="3" required placeholder="Your property goals..."></textarea></label><label class="contact-consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required><span>I consent to being contacted about this enquiry and acknowledge the privacy notice.</span></label><button type="submit">Send enquiry <span>↗</span></button><p id="contact-feedback" data-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite">No live CRM endpoint is connected unless explicitly configured.</p></form></div></div></section>
</Shell>